   "subject": "Using now(env) in mclapply{} and wrap()",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi Bart and Iñaki,</div><div><br></div><div>I absolutely love the simmer-package. However, I&#39;ve run into a problem I cannot solve. </div><div>I am currently simulating the queue for an outpatient clinic in order to investigate the acces time for new patients. The waiting time for patients that visit regularly is not interesting. After all, it&#39;s not weird that a regular patient has to wait half a year for a new appointment, if there is no medical necessity to see him earlier. However, those patients do make us of the same resources (i.e. doctors). I&#39;ve carried this out by a timeout of the average time between repetitive consultations and then setting the prioritization of a regular patient higher than a new patient. </div><div><br></div><div>In order to keep track of the waiting time for a new patient, I&#39;ve set attributes that appoint the Starting time of the queuing of a patient and the waiting time of the patient, by using now(env) - Starting time. </div><div>Below, one can find my (adapted) code. </div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">patientpath </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> trajectory</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Patients&#39; path&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  set_attribute</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Starttime&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> now</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">env</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  log_</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Patient waits&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  seize</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;doctor&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  set_attribute</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;waitingtime&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">attr</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">now</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">env</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> attr</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">[[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Starttime&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">]]))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  log_</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Start appointment&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  timeout</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  log_</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;End appointment&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  release</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;doctor&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  branch</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">option </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> sample</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> prob </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">0.73</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">0.73</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">continue</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">F</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> <br>         trajectory</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>           log_</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;No other appointments necessary&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>         </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  log_</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Another appointment necessary&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  timeout</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> <br>  set_prioritization</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">values </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">7</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  seize</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;doctor&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">  <br>  log_</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;Start appointment&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  timeout</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,136)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\">#</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  log_</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;End appointment&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  release</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;doctor&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>  rollback</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">9</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102)\">Inf</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> <br><br>env </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> simmer</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> <br>    add_resource</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;doctor&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> capacity </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>    add_generator</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;person&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> patientpath</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> at</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">10</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> mon </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> <br><br>env  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> run</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,102,102)\">50</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></div></code></div><p><br></p><div><br></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Whenever I\r\nrun it once, no problems occur. However, when I run it multiple times, by using\r\nmclappy and wrap(), the simulation doesn&#39;t know what to do with now(env), since\r\nenv has become a list. </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"2\">My question\r\nhere is twofold: </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;direction:ltr\"><li style=\"font-style:normal\"><p style=\"font-style:normal;margin-top:0cm;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Is\r\nthere a way in which I can investigate the queue of only the new patients without\r\nthe use of now()? (I’ve tried join(), without success)</font></span></p></li><li style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal\"><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;margin-top:0cm;margin-bottom:10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Can\r\nI use mclapply and now() somehow at the same time? </font></span></p></li></ul><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Thanks in\r\nadvance,</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><font size=\"2\">Dominique</font> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "jcPvPgelAgAJ",
   "from": "Iñaki Úcar",
   "author": "0f5b7adb7e70bd8b",
   "date": "2017-06-26T15:40:21Z",
   "subject": "Re: [simmer-devel] Using now(env) in mclapply{} and wrap()",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Hi Dominique,</p></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"></p><div><p></p><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"2\">My question\r\nhere is twofold: </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"2\">\r\n\r\n</font><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;direction:ltr\"><li style=\"font-style:normal\"><p style=\"font-style:normal;margin-top:0cm;margin-bottom:0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Is\r\nthere a way in which I can investigate the queue of only the new patients without\r\nthe use of now()? (I’ve tried join(), without success)</font></span></p></li></ul></div></div></blockquote><p></p></div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"></p>\r\n</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Yes, there is. You just need to extract the arrivals per resource. This data frame contains all access to resources. Given that you are interested in the first-timers, you need to keep the first appearance of each person, filtering out everything else. In dplyr terms,</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">library</span>(dplyr)\r\n\r\nwaiting_time &lt;- get_mon_arrivals(env, per_resource=<span>TRUE</span>) %&gt;%\r\n  group_by(replication, name) %&gt;%\r\n  slice(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">1</span>) %&gt;%\r\n  transmute(waiting_time = end_time - start_time - activity_time)\r\n</code></pre></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"></p><div><p></p><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;direction:ltr\"><li style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal\"><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;margin-top:0cm;margin-bottom:10pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"arial,sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Can\r\nI use mclapply and now() somehow at the same time?</font></span></p></li></ul></div></div></blockquote><p></p></div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"></p>\r\n</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Given my first answer, you don’t need <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">now()</code> anymore, but yes, you can. You just need to enclose your whole simulation inside the function you pass to <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">mclapply</code>, including the trajectory. Why? Because it is calling <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">now(env)</code>, so that the <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">env</code> should be defined in the same level as the trajectory itself. For instance:</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248)\">my_simulation &lt;- <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">function</span>(i) {\r\n  patientpath &lt;- trajectory(<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;Patients&#39; path&quot;</span>)  %&gt;%\r\n    set_attribute(<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;Starttime&quot;</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">function</span>() now(env)) %&gt;%\r\n    <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">...</span></code></pre></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248)\">\r\n\r\n  env &lt;- simmer() %&gt;% \r\n    add_resource(<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;doctor&quot;</span>, capacity = <span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">2</span>) %&gt;%\r\n    add_generator(<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;person&quot;</span>, patientpath, at(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">0</span>:<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">10</span>), mon = <span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">2</span></code></pre></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248)\">) \r\n\r\n  env %&gt;% \r\n    run(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">50</span>) %&gt;%\r\n    wrap()\r\n}\r\n\r\nenvs &lt;- mclapply(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">1</span>:<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">100</span>, my_simulation)\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Regards,</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:SGkgRG9taW5pcXVlLDxkaXYgY2xhc3M9ImdtYWlsX2V4dHJhIj48YnI+PGRpdiBjbGFzcz0iZ21h\r\naWxfcXVvdGUiPjxibG9ja3F1b3RlIGNsYXNzPSJnbWFpbF9xdW90ZSIgc3R5bGU9Im1hcmdpbjog\r\nMHB4IDBweCAwcHggMC44ZXg7IGJvcmRlci1sZWZ0OiAxcHggc29saWQgcmdiKDIwNCwgMjA0LCAy\r\nMDQpOyBwYWRkaW5nLWxlZnQ6IDFleDsiPjxkaXYgZGlyPSJsdHIiPjxkaXY+PHAgc3R5bGU9Im1h\r\ncmdpbjogMGNtIDBjbSAxMHB0OyI+PHNwYW4gbGFuZz0iRU4tVVMiPjxmb250IGNvbG9yPSIjMDAw\r\nMDAwIiBmYWNlPSJhcmlhbCxzYW5zLXNlcmlmIiBzaXplPSIyIj5NeSBxdWVzdGlvbgpoZXJlIGlz\r\nIHR3b2ZvbGQ6IDwvZm9udD48L3NwYW4+PC9wPjxmb250IGNvbG9yPSIjMDAwMDAwIiBmYWNlPSJh\r\ncmlhbCxzYW5zLXNlcmlmIiBzaXplPSIyIj4KCjwvZm9udD48dWwgc3R5bGU9Imxpc3Qtc3R5bGUt\r\ndHlwZTogZGlzYzsgZGlyZWN0aW9uOiBsdHI7Ij48bGkgc3R5bGU9ImZvbnQtc3R5bGU6IG5vcm1h\r\nbDsiPjxwIHN0eWxlPSJmb250LXN0eWxlOiBub3JtYWw7IG1hcmdpbi10b3A6IDBjbTsgbWFyZ2lu\r\nLWJvdHRvbTogMHB0OyI+PHNwYW4gbGFuZz0iRU4tVVMiPjxmb250IGZhY2U9ImFyaWFsLHNhbnMt\r\nc2VyaWYiIHNpemU9IjIiPklzCnRoZXJlIGEgd2F5IGluIHdoaWNoIEkgY2FuIGludmVzdGlnYXRl\r\nIHRoZSBxdWV1ZSBvZiBvbmx5IHRoZSBuZXcgcGF0aWVudHMgd2l0aG91dAp0aGUgdXNlIG9mIG5v\